# Sawblade Skinripper's end step trigger has the intervening "if you sacrificed one or more permanents this turn" (CR 603.4):
# on turn 1 and again on turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices nothing, so the ability never goes on the stack and asks for no target, and Bot2
# loses no life. A permanent Bot1 merely loses another way (a Lightning Bolt killing its Ornithopter on turn 2) is not a sacrifice.

